# Environment — no `.env*` file is tracked except the templates the fleet's published-secret
# gate allowlists (`tracked-secret-check.sh`). `.env.dev` was tracked here and the gate refuses
# the whole push for it (t_47698f73); it stays on disk, it is just no longer published.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!.env.*.example
!.env.sample
!.env.template

